The function also includes robust error checking for invalid input, including non-positive numbers, excessively large sizes, and malformed date formats. It handles concurrent modifications to project statuses and start_dates without causing data corruption. The implementation gracefully manages edge cases such as attempting to access or modify out-of-bounds elements, and properly frees all allocated memory before the function exits.

