The code is designed to be scalable and integrates seamlessly with an external logging system for detailed error tracking and performance monitoring. It also handles cases where the remote server is temporarily unavailable by providing a fallback mechanism using cached images or placeholder icons. Additionally, the code manages memory efficiently by releasing resources when they are no longer needed and ensuring that the avatar cache does not grow indefinitely.']

