The function also supports dynamic adjustment of parameters based on environmental conditions and network load, providing adaptive reporting intervals and reduced sampling rates during periods of high activity. Considerations for power consumption optimization and battery life management should be integrated into the design, especially for mobile sensor nodes. Integrate features for real-time anomaly detection and alerting, enhancing the system's responsiveness to environmental anomalies.

